WEBVTT

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:20.100
When we use our power, the panacea 
fluid in our blood becomes impure.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.700
They may fear us as monsters, 
but in the end, this is all we can do.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.880
It's pathetic.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:28.210
How's your left arm doing, Millaarc-chan?

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:34.010
I guess it's true that the blade of Zababa 
cuts both physically and spiritually.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.230
It's healing slowly...

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.110
I see.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:44.630
The users and the used...

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:50.520
If you call it a honeymoon, 
I wonder how long it will last.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.420
<b>Episode 4
The Name of the Flower Is Amalgam</b>

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:38.520
Are you going back to HQ after school again?

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:42.060
Yeah. There are people who need me.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.790
That's just like you, Hibiki.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:44.560
But...

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.670
But to tell you the truth, 
I really would rather not!

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:50.730
I'd rather go play and have fun!

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:53.450
That sounds like you.

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:57.000
Let's hang out soon if 
I can get time off!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.180
We'll do karaoke or something!

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:02.650
Want to invite Tsubasa-san, 
like we did before?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:07.790
Yeah! I want to help
 cheer her up!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.510
A new enemy...

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:14.470
Noble Red, the remnants of 
the Bavarian Illuminati.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.040
What are they after?

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:21.670
After the last incident, 
the RH Soil type whole blood

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:25.060
has all been gathered in 
one place for its protection.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:30.720
I never thought we'd have this much 
trouble after we already beat them.

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:35.230
Yes. Their three leaders 
were much tougher.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:36.740
So why?

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:40.690
We were just caught off guard by 
how far they're willing to go.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.940
Right?

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:44.890
Our gears contain Saint Germain 
and the others' feelings.

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:46.690
We can't lose with them.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.000
Hey, Tsubasa.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.010
Where are we going?

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:55.470
The training room. If they're coming up
 with all these new tricks,

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.960
we just need to be strong 
enough to defeat them.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:00.570
Tsubasa-san!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:05.190
I was thinking we could all go 
to karaoke if we had time.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.680
So you could come, too.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.750
I'm sorry. Can you ask somebody else?

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.520
You're here early.

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:26.840
Are you in such a hurry?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:30.510
The bracelet activates soon, yes?

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:38.790
There are more ways to activate 
a relic than just phonic gain.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:44.340
The light of the seven planets that 
correspond to the seven scales...

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:48.020
Music and alchemy came 
about in different ways,

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:52.110
but they are both technological systems that 
strive to find the truth within harmonics.

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.950
With the motions of the stars 
on this day, in this hour,

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:57.260
the heartbeat of awakening is here!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.950
It's activated... right?

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:18.550
<i>What? An old man can't be this strong!</i>

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:21.120
You have another role.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.340
Those are the people from before.

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.900
Deal with them.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:29.460
They can't even run a simple errand!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.480
I won't ask for forgiveness.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:45.160
Monster! You monsters!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.140
I refuse to just die!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:56.090
If you're going to kill me, 
I'll use this instead!

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.000
This sound!

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:14.380
The divine power will not let 
itself be used so easily?

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.510
But I've already made my next move!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.790
Dishupine's Barrier!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.930
They'll be here any minute!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.400
I have a proposal!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:38.820
Songs... cannot protect anything.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.220
<i>Alca-Noise signal detected!</i>

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:46.500
Two Wielders are already on their way!

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.770
They got here so fast, too...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:14.650
<i>Seilien coffin Airgetlám tron.</i>

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:01.790
<i>I just need to protect the places close to me</i>

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:05.790
<i>It's all I can do</i>

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:09.420
<i>I'm given another thousand wounds</i>

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:17.380
<i>I find pride in enduring the pain
 and diving through the moment</i>

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:19.980
<i>It's because I am so weak</i>

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:28.360
<i>That I was happy just to grab 
the happiness I could see</i>

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:34.280
<i>But the wind called time 
doesn't just heal my wounds</i>

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:33.120
Can you tell us what it is you want?

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:43.380
<i>The world said "the possibilities 
are endless" and pushed me forward.</i>

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:40.980
I surrender. I don't think we can 
beat you in a straight-up fight.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:42.380
Let's come to an understanding.

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.890
I don't want to come to <i>that</i> 
kind of understanding!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:50.870
<i>As long as I have a sky to howl "damn!" to</i>

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.620
Just kidding.

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:54.040
<i>No matter what enemy tramples me down</i>

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:56.390
<i>Even if my arm breaks</i>

00:08:56.390 --> 00:09:01.540
<i>Then I'll punch them with the broken arm</i>

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:59.800
Our goal is... Oh, yes,

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:03.130
to go back to being normal girls 
and friends with everyone.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.150
<i>Sky, sky</i>

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:05.940
<i>It's okay if I lose to the enemy</i>

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.840
How about that?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:12.020
<i>My fire burns by not losing to myself</i>

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.620
Oh, dear.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:19.330
<i>There is only one reason 
I can fight instead of run</i>

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:22.530
<i>Comrades I love, family, bonds</i>

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:22.230
Is this bad? I think this might be bad.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.970
<i>I protect them with all my power</i>

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.480
<i>Go ahead, go ahead</i>

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:30.040
<i>Struggling gallantly against the future</i>

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.620
<i>Go ahead, go ahead</i>

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:34.460
<i>Turn your fears into hope</i>

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:38.040
<i>And even if you're shivering, go forward!</i>

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:42.430
<i>Now it's time for me to strike!</i>

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.580
<i>Vanessa!</i>

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:55.910
I took the bracelet and the person
 I'm escorting out of the combat area.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:59.830
Roger. I'll withdraw, too.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.460
Let's meet at the rendezvous point.

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.910
Wait!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.950
Are you sure there's no point in talking?

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.610
We can't come to an understanding?

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.560
We can't.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:14.700
People reject and isolate 
that which is different.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:25.050
Reject and isolate?

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.290
What is this?

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.840
Analyze this immediately.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.920
<i>I couldn't win... again...</i>

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:46.730
<i>But there was something I learned.</i>

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:51.790
<i>The source of their power...  
their victory... is rejection.</i>

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:53.550
<i>Which means I...</i>

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.290
<i>And...</i>

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.270
<i>We're done, Hibiki-chan.</i>

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.170
<i>I didn't see anything unusual.</i>

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:07.110
<i>Can you come to the command 
room when you're ready?</i>

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:09.410
<i>We're having a meeting 
about what to do next.</i>

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:20.840
Losing our hideout doesn't just mean 
losing our return point for the teleport.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:24.760
It means losing a roof and 
walls to keep out the rain.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.630
Big sis learned something new today.

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:33.010
And until we find our next place, 
we're sleeping in a car.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:36.540
Honestly, the world has it out for us.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.600
There was nothing we could do.

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:45.440
We know that S.O.N.G. will come 
after the Alca-Noise signals.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:48.390
But... we can't let them 
have a way to find us,

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.070
or find any traces of the 
activation experiment.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:55.360
Don't worry. It'll work out!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:58.250
Elza-chan, you're a good girl.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:05.240
Wh-What's wrong? What's wrong, Elza-chan?

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:13.780
Everybody's here.

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.250
First, look at this.

00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:21.450
That's an Aufbachen waveform.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:24.110
And different than ours...

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.290
Does that mean...

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:30.250
Yes. We can assume they tried to 
activate the stolen bracelet.

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:35.430
The pattern was almost lost 
in the Alca-Noise signals.

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.110
But we were barely able to detect it.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:41.670
They probably did the ritual on the 
other side of a powerful barrier.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:45.560
Like the Opera House in Valverde...

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:50.280
We observed something else, too.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.820
What is this?

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:56.910
Music?

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.620
If it is, it's a mess!

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.730
<i>I've never heard sound 
arranged like this before.</i>

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.780
<i>But, somewhere, I've...</i>

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:10.750
We're still investigating the music.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:14.350
But putting together all this information,

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.550
we can assume that 
Noble Red did something big.

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:21.030
I think it's time we attack, then.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.570
But attack... how?

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.040
Maria-kun.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:30.810
I put a transmitter on them 
during the last battle.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.310
Noble Red...

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:35.500
They don't seem used to 
fighting weaker opponents.

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.290
So they came to meet us? 
That was nice of them!

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.680
Let's go!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:54.470
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.570
<i>If you've crossed over...</i>

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.140
What?

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:47.190
We revealed ourselves to 
control where you landed.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:50.800
All we had to do was
 plant land mines there...

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:52.490
Too easy!

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:55.310
A transmitter? They got us!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:56.280
What do we do?

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:00.110
We can't run. We've got 
no hideout to run to.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:02.630
We'll just have to fight.

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.850
But how?

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:08.600
There is a way.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.220
Danger approaches.

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:16.840
But the three of us are together, 
and have enough whole blood.

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:24.860
If the whole area's a minefield...

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:29.560
There aren't any mines left 
where they already blew up!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.470
We predicted that, too!

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.500
Let's go!

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:47.260
We won't let you!

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:56.000
Impossible! Even Yukine's 
firepower can't break it?

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.720
Let it be so.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.900
Wh-Where am I?

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.570
Kiri-chan? Guys?

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:17.410
Where are you?

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.200
My blade won't work...

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.870
So it won't be easy to escape?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.500
What's going on?

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:33.460
The greatest work of 
Master Daedalus is here.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:36.180
The labyrinth where a monster lurks...

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:41.720
The accumulated awareness from the legends,
 traditions, and countless myths,

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.840
says "Let it be so," and 
alters reality itself.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.340
A philosophical weapon!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:50.610
The three of us, who were 
mocked as monsters,

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:54.260
have created a philosophical labyrinth 
over 380,000 km long.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.940
Nobody it catches will escape!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:59.200
And that's not all!

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:03.610
Wh-Wh-What is this?

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:07.540
You guys?

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.500
It's coming! A shock wave!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.680
Daedalus End!

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:23.520
If you compress and combust energy 
within a confined space...

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:28.600
Even weak power like ours 
can multiply exponentially.

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:30.740
Never corner a wounded animal!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:34.180
But the enemy are still Symphogears.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:36.450
It won't be that easy, I guess.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:39.020
Then, with one more attack...

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.530
Everyone!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.540
I can't win... Why?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.490
With these gears that hold the emotions 
of Saint Germain and the others...

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:54.120
You can't win? Then let me ask you.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.210
What did you lose to?

00:17:57.450 --> 00:17:59.380
Saint Germain-san?

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:03.150
Who did you lose to, Tachibana Hibiki?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:04.890
<i>That's right.</i>

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.780
<i>I lost to myself.</i>

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:11.090
<i>To the me who forgot
 to keep struggling to win.</i>

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:13.500
I will help you,

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:16.920
so don't forget, Tachibana Hibiki...

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.830
Clench your fists to stay 
true to your feelings.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.440
I won't forget...

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:25.800
to open my fist to connect the feelings 
that passed each other by...

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:29.650
and to clutch tight the 
justice I believe in!

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:36.640
Daedalus End... Full Throttle!

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:39.650
This time we'll destroy the labyrinth itself!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.870
With this power!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:59.890
Even if that's true!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.950
A golden barrier field...

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.160
What is this?

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:08.870
Saint Germain and the others held our hands!

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:09.950
What?

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:12.490
They lent us their power!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:21.460
<i>Hit 'em head on, right in 
the middle, never giving up!</i>

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:26.710
<i>Give it everything you have 
and go beyond your limits!</i>

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:34.560
<i>Each of us holds a different justice, but</i>

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.480
<i>For now we're brave!</i>

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:36.390
<i>It's time for us to come together!</i>

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:41.940
<i>We struggled against the 
agony of being controlled</i>

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:41.600
The power of the Symphogears, 
rebuilt by the Philosopher's Stone.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:46.540
They released the energy that constructs the 
gears and created high-density barriers.

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:46.870
<i>It felt like we could 
share what's in our hearts</i>

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:52.780
<i>A hammer containing our 
ultimate (ultimate) feelings</i>

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.470
Dynamic!

00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:57.340
<i>Let's unleash it together</i>

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.480
<i>I trust! Blooming Courage</i>

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.140
<i>Not just clenching tight</i>

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:07.940
<i>I want to open my hand and connect</i>

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.600
This is bad!

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:10.930
<i>I believe! Blooming Courage</i>

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.850
<i>Even if we believe in different things</i>

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:16.360
And by using most of their energy
 for attacks, they become unbeatable.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:18.690
<i>Now for someone's sake</i>

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.350
It's...

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:22.710
<i>Scream "Even if that's true!"</i>

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:21.850
The fusion of a Symphogear and a Faust Robe!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:22.950
Amalgam!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:28.300
I can't give up!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.080
That's right.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:37.070
We can't run away!

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:42.340
<i>Grab your hand and tell you sadly</i>

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:47.560
<i>that it's okay to clench it, 
words lost in air</i>

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.540
One more hit!

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:53.220
<i>Cruelty laughs at us</i>

00:20:53.220 --> 00:20:59.940
<i>But still I sing and connect!</i>

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:03.820
<i>I trust! Blooming Courage</i>

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:06.270
<i>Not just clenching tight</i>

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:11.330
<i>I want to open my hand and connect</i>

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.160
Elza-chan! Millaarc-chan!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.120
<i>I believe! Blooming Courage</i>

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:16.970
But even so, we seek the 
power of the gods...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.100
<i>Even if we believe in different things</i>

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:22.010
So we can use it to return our human bodies!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:22.000
<i>Now, to the heaven in front of you</i>

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:29.670
<i>Scream "Even if that's true!"</i>

00:21:35.820 --> 00:21:37.220
Why?

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:39.960
I don't know if you're 
telling the truth or not.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:43.610
But you said you wanted to be friends.

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:44.930
So...

00:21:49.900 --> 00:21:54.470
<i>As of this moment, all Wielders
 are to abort the mission.</i>

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:56.540
<i>This message comes from 
the Japanese government.</i>

00:21:57.990 --> 00:21:59.950
<i>What the hell do you mean, old man?</i>
